Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:05.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伊利诺伊州 芝加哥市）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.06,0:00:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿实在是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还 还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 Roth\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你觉得甜言蜜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think laying it on thick like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能有什么进展的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is gonna get you somewhere tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就想对了吗 - 你就想太对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm right? - You're totally right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.89,0:00:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不闹了 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, spill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么带我来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roth先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Roth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.47,0:00:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚很隆重啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard it's a big night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.13,0:00:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 最隆重的一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the biggest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把这个放在香槟酒里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you put this in a glass of champagne.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.46,0:01:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者其他什么里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是独特\N{\fnArial\fs30}How unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sal\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 太久了 Maurice\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too long, Maurice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最近怎么样 - 还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How've you been, man? - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么样 - 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you doing - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.14,0:01:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.74,0:01:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 Marv\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, chill out, Marv.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.53,0:01:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.39,0:01:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How've you been.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.91,0:01:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 Lassiter先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Mr.Lassiter.Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,时而出力 时而收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you give and sometimes you get.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.51,0:01:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你真的能收获许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you really get.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.33,0:01:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿Mindy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mindy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.01,0:01:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢金发的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aww, I liked you as a blonde.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样呢 我听说你们进了点儿好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better?I hear they have more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Julian\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来找麻烦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想喝杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.29,0:02:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想吃Taylor Swift的心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to eat Taylor Swift's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.18,0:02:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们不总能得到我们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can't always get what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.54,0:02:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,挪一挪你的变形怪屁股 赶紧滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get your shifter ass out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这群狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得你们高人一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're so special.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上不过是一群狗娘养的的杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}And really you're just sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这点儿能耐 - 相信我 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That all you got - Oh trust me, slugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,比这要多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,多多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑哪儿去 虚张声势的胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where're you going you yeller.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.23,0:03:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ennis\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我们的天地\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你把我拉上渡轮码头是要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you dragged me to a ferry stop, why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是在渡轮上相遇的 八年级那次出游\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met on a ferry, that field trip, 8th grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你编了长辫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have your hair in braids and.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.99,0:04:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的目光就再也离不开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't take my eyes off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有我们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以 - 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So - Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,David 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,David 谁是David\N{\fnArial\fs30}David?Who's David.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有其他选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.97,0:04:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tamara\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tamara\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:25.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北芝加哥大学）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,W.L.Graham\N{\fnArial\fs30}数学系主任.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,主任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,您在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去下办公室 你怎么没去吃午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}My office.Why aren't you at lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些文件要看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paper work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你和你妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you and your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个周末出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have gone away for the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.79,0:05:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have, we are, I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了点儿东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgot something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.41,0:05:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:02.53,Note,0,0,0,0,,（Margo来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.38,0:06:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Matt 我是David Lassiter\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt, it's David Lassiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,散布消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经拿到数学答案了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got an answer to the math final.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.77,0:06:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,50美元一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 bucks a pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.65,0:06:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Teddy的彩陶馆 我是小肉桂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy's house of pinatas, cinnamon speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.55,0:06:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不好笑 该死的 David你到底在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not funny, David where the hell are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要回家一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Margo，Margo镇静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo, Margo, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.25,0:06:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,David听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先必须回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to come home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Sal出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Sal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.93,0:06:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sal怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Sal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的哥哥死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our brother is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚我到底看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你告诉我你看到了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause what you're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个面目全非的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}About this faceless whatever-it-is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.03,0:07:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西有爪子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing has claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能 当时你有些迷糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, maybe you are confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.37,0:07:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是拿着刀的小混混什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe maybe with some banger with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我到底看到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我当做骗子是帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By calling me a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你爸简直一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are just like your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nate Ross 他是位很出色的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate Ross, he's a great cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,教会了我很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tought me everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他的脾气却一直坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his temper never did many favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道你很不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you had a tough break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么小就没有了爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing your dad as young as you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.92,0:07:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经尽我所能在帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have done all that I can to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果你再这样不分黑白地\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you go But if you go off half-cocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,满口乱喷怪物什么的胡话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spouting this monster crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.69,0:07:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者继续做蠢事的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or doing something stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.61,0:07:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也帮不了你什么了 Ennis\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you anymore, Ennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我看到的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员Bonhan和Peart\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Bonham and Peart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,FBI 接下来交给我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI we will take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like hell you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.53,0:07:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,FBI什么时候对持刀伤人的案子感兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when did the Feebs start working on stabbings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, ditective.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个惯犯和之前的描述很相符\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perp fits a certain profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你说明细节 但是我懒得跟你废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I could go into detail, but I'm, I'm not going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.11,0:08:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来聊聊昨天晚上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, let's talk about last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你们也想说我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?Do you call me crazy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,说一说也无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到她身边时 她\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I got to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}She…she's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经无能为力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing you could have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 你说这话是想安慰我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose that helps me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西根本不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this thing wasn't human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.13,0:08:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你们想怎么对付那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you going to do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道该怎么跟你讲 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to tell you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上没有怪物这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Margo 镇定点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.99,0:08:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说镇定 探长先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me to calm down, detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,食尸鬼家族到底愿不愿意支持我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me the ghouls, are they with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能吧 - 什么叫可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是拿不到钱的 Freddie\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't pay for maybe, Freddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,切入正题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut to the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照你父亲目前的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your pop the way he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上Sal的去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now Sal's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,各大家族表示很忧虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Families have concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉那群食尸鬼 鬼灵 还是什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the ghouls, the Djinn the.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是我在管理这个家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever I run this family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管放马过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they can either back ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把他们打趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll bend them over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把点四五口径的枪对准他们 射空弹夹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jam a.45 elbow deep and empty the damn clip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Margo\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.85,0:09:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually came.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 David\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Sal的事很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, sorry about Sal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.86,0:09:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个 是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was…he was a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Julian Duval干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian Duval happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和Sal在Il Secundo饭店的密室中有了口角\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and Sal had words in the backroom of Il Secundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那个狼人派人包围了饭店 毁了整个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the wolf circled around and tore that place apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.99,0:09:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他掏出了Sal的心脏 他会为之付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He clawed out Sal's heart, and he will bleed for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.74,0:10:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你能给她讲讲道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can talk some sense into her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是没辙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause I sure as hell can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Margo\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是步枪协会的什么节日吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the NRA Christmas here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.57,0:10:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.39,0:10:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要走向战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不喜欢 去跟爸爸说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like it?Talk to daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道爸爸状况这么不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know papa was this bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一走就是三年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been gone 3 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.80,0:10:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Margo 你确定是Julian吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo, are you sure it was Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.71,0:10:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause he's got a witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲眼见到Julian了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And saw Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他恨Sal\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hated Sal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew it, and I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个城市都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the whole damn city knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个混蛋找准了机会 然后就动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dick saw his shot, and he took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个杂种杀了我们哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mutt gutted our brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是狼人做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the werewolves did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.79,0:10:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果 看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If?Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾尽全力来保护那个这么多年来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falling all over yourself to defend the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.90,0:11:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直骑在我们头上的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's had their foot on our neck for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟以前没什么两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.14,0:11:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的前任快要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ex is getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.99,0:11:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 对吧 Violet\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.21,0:11:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爸把她卖给了纽约的狼人家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her father pimped her out to the New York wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了完成什么交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}To seal some deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说不去反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not saying don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am saying being smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.59,0:11:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果真的是Julian做的 - 你会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And if Julian did this - Then you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了吧 David\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不想参与这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃离家族去做人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run away to be a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是同情他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always have a soft spot for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你走了 就在外边别回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you are out, stay out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不来点儿什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure I can't get you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,波旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bourbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真觉得变形怪们会有所举动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think the shifters will make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Margo可不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo is not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.11,0:12:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Julian\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行 Violet\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须谈谈 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚听说Sal Lassiter死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just heard Sal Lassiter's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.35,0:12:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我能为你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear, whatever shall I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,从他的尸体来看 Sal死的很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the look at his body, Sal died quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在哪儿看见他的尸体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you saw his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.26,0:12:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我观察很仔细 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thorough, ain't I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不关我的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要见那个灵怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you meeting with the Djinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.14,0:13:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为Margo Lassiter\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.32,0:13:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小贱人想让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margo Lassiter wants me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她认定是我杀了她兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks I sliced up her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就只好恭敬不如从命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm not gonna tell her any different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且变形怪们做的太过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what those shifters have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们的领地上嚣张造势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chipping away at our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,侮辱我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insulting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争不可避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a war coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要那位纹身兄站在我这一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need Tattoo there on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 Julian\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Julian, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在盘算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是我们的玩物而已 小公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the bitch in this pack, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要打扮得漂漂亮亮的 然后闭上你的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your job is to be pretty and silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,打仗 或是不打仗 不是你能决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So war, no war, you don't get a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.14,0:14:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tamara\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tamara.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝加哥警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicago PD.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.15,0:16:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在原地不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.94,0:16:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙还是没脑袋的时候更顺眼 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks better with a little off the top, don't you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.81,0:16:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想跑路的话 现在可以跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna run.Now it's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪儿都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going any where.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非有人跟我解释一下这都是怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until someone tells me what the hell is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 Sammy 你来讲解一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, Sammy, give him the talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我叫Sam Winchester\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, look, my name is Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.40,0:17:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我哥 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my brother, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猎杀吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We kill vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人 恶魔 和\N{\fnArial\fs30}And werewolves and demons and.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单来说 我们追踪鬼怪 然后砍了他们的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically we chase down evil and we cut its head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.31,0:17:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么杀了我女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what killed my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.35,0:17:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在查\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working on it, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你告诉我们的 那东西是个新面孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from what you told us, this thing sounds new.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:47.12,Title,0,0,0,0,,要不就是Freddy Krueger（《猛鬼街》中的反派）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Freddy Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我从镜子里看到的那个家伙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about that guy I saw in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一张腐烂掉的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a messed up face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是个幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably a Wraith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.93,0:17:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多超自然生物都会以人形出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, a lot of these things can look human.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是镜子会让他们露出马脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you catch them in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.23,0:17:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者照相机也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or sometimes a camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你们找到那个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…you find this whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们砍了它的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna chop his head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.30,0:18:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 要是有顾虑 可以用银弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or sometimes, when in doubt try silver bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.79,0:18:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.43,0:18:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个柜子里装满了肉和血袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is full of blood and meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.08,0:18:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多生肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上这一块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一块叫做Susan\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is labled Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.53,0:18:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道这儿是酒吧暗房之类的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?Some kind of backroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物VIP密室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster VIP.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well if it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sal Lassiter之前来过这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sal Lassiter was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he is not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢 现在怪物开始互相残杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?We've got monster killing monster now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.07,0:18:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧 我们找到了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.We got this in body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.79,0:18:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No you're gonna stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然呢 你会伤害我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what, You gonna hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.73,0:18:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱的女孩死了 我的人生也毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the girl I love ruin my damn life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.23,0:18:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在才说这些太晚了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah you too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着Ennis\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ennis listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我了解你的感受 我曾经也感同身受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.Believe me, I have been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们做的事情 根本不是你能想象的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what we do, it's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你最好不要搀和进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do yourself a favour and stay on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你也会受到牵连的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will get hurt too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我们能谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can we talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.05,0:19:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上 杀死Tamara的那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night, this thing you think killed Tamara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它长什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did it look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.81,0:19:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己说的 是持刀的小混混干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it was some banger with a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能放过任何线索嘛 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chasing out every lead, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.68,0:19:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 它的脸被蒙住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I told you, it didn't have much of a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.65,0:20:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 它有没有说过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He…it…whatever say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.69,0:20:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那再告诉我一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tell me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你有时间 为什么不多留一会儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you got time why don't you hang around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老爸还在墓园 但他马上就能回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's working the graveyard, but he'll be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.29,0:20:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他见到你会很开心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd love to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.01,0:20:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.16,0:20:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样高兴见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.93,0:20:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, text.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能说什么呢 我知道这很不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say…I know this is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚那鬼东西把我的外套划破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that thing slashed up my jacket pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察已经检查过了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forensics went over it, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you wanna see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.64,0:20:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.70,0:20:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你的合作 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:20:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这把枪里装着银弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a sliver bullet in this gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ennis\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ennis 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ennis, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.56,0:21:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是Freddy Custer 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not Freddy Custer, so who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是David Lassiter 我是个变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is David Lassiter, I am an shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.83,0:21:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.93,0:21:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能变形\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shift our shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.80,0:21:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,听名字就能大概知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind all there in our name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sal Lassiter是我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sal Lassiter is my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道谁杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to find out who killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你变成了另外一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you slape on somebody else's faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.79,0:21:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kinda my go-to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.75,0:21:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了警方的报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I read the police report.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.66,0:21:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你也失去了你重要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you lost someone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要提到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you don't talk about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道外面发生了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's going on out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.88,0:21:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有任何想法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物 猎人 我大概知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, freaks hunters, yeah, I got the basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.62,0:21:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是自身难保啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!Are you so in over your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.03,0:21:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我简略的告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you a short version.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,芝加哥被五个怪物家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicago has been divided up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所掌控着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between five monster families.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.15,0:22:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is that a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见有人笑了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear the laugh track.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.30,0:22:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那警察呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.10,0:22:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We own the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 上到勒索敲诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I'm talkinga about shakedowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.88,0:22:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,下到器官贩卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Organ Trafficking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.37,0:22:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人家族在黄金海岸一带影响力颇大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The werewolf threaten the Gold Coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵怪掌握着南部\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Djinn own the South side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.39,0:22:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想引人注目\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to keep the low profile so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.77,0:22:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们尽量保持和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep the peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.98,0:22:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样人类也不会死伤太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human casualty is the minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.73,0:22:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会死伤太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想这样 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I don't like it either, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.64,0:22:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道隐藏在和平之下蠢蠢欲动的是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you know what's behind door number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.77,0:22:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}War.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类与怪物在街上血腥的争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's boold.Human and monsters in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.34,0:22:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.27,0:22:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人想阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is actually one guy trying to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.24,0:22:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}WOW!Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.68,0:22:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想给你鼓个掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd slow clap but well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.12,0:22:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜 我腾不出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands are a little full.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别搀和进来好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay out of it, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.65,0:22:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些划痕上有银的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}These cuts are flecked with sliver.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.14,0:22:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.62,0:22:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它有灼烧感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause it burns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.56,0:23:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.31,0:23:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Julian Duval可没有银爪子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian Duval hasn't got silver claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.84,0:23:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.17,0:23:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.78,0:23:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,验尸官说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The…eh…coroner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.14,0:23:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个叫Julian Duval的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says this guy, this Julian Duval.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.99,0:23:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,出3000块要求看一看Sal的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shows up, drops 3 grand to see Sal's corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.00,0:24:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还住在一座城堡里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he lives in a feaking castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.32,0:24:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们运气好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we are lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定能在他们的怪物酒馆里碰到几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone might happen to be at their monster bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.81,0:24:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.56,0:24:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装了 David\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can cut the act, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.61,0:24:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.13,0:24:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.95,0:24:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我也了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.76,0:24:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的管家现在还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the real butler okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.62,0:24:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.01,0:24:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在壁橱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked in a closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.22,0:24:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.92,0:24:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我想来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I wanna be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.67,0:24:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了Sal\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Sal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.74,0:24:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说了 我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard.I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.57,0:24:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是Julian干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.69,0:24:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.43,0:24:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想让你找他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I need you to talk to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.17,0:24:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他在酒吧坐下来聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting him to sit down at the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.08,0:24:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能终结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just we can work this crap out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.12,0:24:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way that's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.34,0:25:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能阻止这场战争 Violet\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can stop a war, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.26,0:25:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 Julian不想阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, Julian doesn't want to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.78,0:25:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 怎么阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second, how.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在逃亡 而我 我只是个婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a runaway and I am, I'm a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.69,0:25:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无足轻重\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.89,0:25:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.37,0:25:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始对他们服服帖帖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when did you play their game.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.36,0:25:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.87,0:25:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,也开始把责任都推到纽约来的混蛋身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you lay your debt on some dick from New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.46,0:25:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我有的选吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.51,0:25:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.56,0:25:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,联合车站 午夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Union Station, midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.07,0:25:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来可以选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.77,0:25:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 是你说我们应该离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…you are the one who said we should go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.04,0:25:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,过平凡的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.29,0:25:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你定了时间 地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You set the time, place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.73,0:25:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.21,0:25:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.17,0:25:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.36,0:26:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Violet\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.61,0:26:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Violet\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.24,0:26:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.10,0:26:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.92,0:26:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.52,0:26:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫David Lassiter\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's David Lassiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.06,0:26:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a shapeshifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.70,0:26:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得撤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.08,0:26:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.79,0:26:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了 全下车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's there.Everybody out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.12,0:27:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.43,0:27:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个芝加哥被五个怪物家族统治着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are five monster families that run Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.55,0:27:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼版教父\N{\fnArial\fs30}God Father with fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.35,0:27:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 就算是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.21,0:27:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要不惜一切代价报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need all the help I can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.62,0:27:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙还真是死脑筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he doesn't quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.21,0:27:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.04,0:27:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Violet不接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violet is not picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.52,0:27:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.17,0:27:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是变形怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a shapeshifter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.19,0:27:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.82,0:27:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 酷毙了 - 酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Awesome - Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.86,0:27:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,她带着手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she has her cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能追踪信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could trace the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.71,0:27:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.70,0:27:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 她手机号多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, what's her number.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.05,0:27:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我也带上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.52,0:27:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.17,0:27:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.47,0:27:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 千万别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.97,0:27:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的他是个变形金刚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, he's a freaking transformer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.81,0:27:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你不得和坏人合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometime you gotta work with the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.42,0:27:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能逮到更坏的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get to the worse guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.85,0:27:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 我是透明的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.91,0:27:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我看见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我也是什么怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm something freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.48,0:28:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.33,0:28:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.93,0:28:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.60,0:28:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些有趣的小玩具罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With some fun little toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.88,0:29:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号源在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Singal's coming from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.93,0:29:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 谢谢你 还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks for, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.51,0:29:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女朋友的事 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And about your girlfriend I'm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.48,0:29:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你的道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need no apology from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.13,0:29:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也失去过挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost someone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.62,0:29:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.97,0:29:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我一样在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm trying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.98,0:29:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.46,0:29:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最后有提到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He spoke about you at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.56,0:29:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 David 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, David I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.30,0:29:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.01,0:29:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要开房的话待会儿可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys can kiss and make up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.26,0:29:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有工作要做 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got work to do, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.31,0:30:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,银器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不是人类 是鬼怪的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burns if you are evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.03,0:30:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会灼伤你的皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.25,0:30:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.68,0:30:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.61,0:30:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥 那个变形怪 那个Lassiter\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother, the shifter, Lassiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.26,0:30:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他大卸八块\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ripped him apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.76,0:30:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们之前告诉我说行凶的是野生动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me it was a wild animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多年来我都深信不疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have believed it for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.48,0:30:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我现在知道真相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.16,0:30:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 Sal和Julian都很恨对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Sal and Julian hated each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.17,0:30:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们不会伤害这个孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither of them would hurt the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.21,0:30:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.59,0:30:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们明天就会找到你的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow they will find pieces of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.29,0:30:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,散落在整个镇子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.23,0:31:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些兽类马上就会发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}All doggies be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.95,0:31:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.55,0:31:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想挑起战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are trying to start a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.99,0:31:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物们之间挑起内讧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaks start killing freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.67,0:31:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We win.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.92,0:31:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 一旦战争开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, once it starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.47,0:31:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过 有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.78,0:31:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少孩子 会因此丧命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many children will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.10,0:31:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我走 罗密欧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're with me, Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.76,0:31:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着不错 吸血鬼猎人Buffy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good, Buffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.90,0:32:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dave Dave\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dave, Dave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.38,0:32:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 Violet\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.33,0:33:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我又得杀鸡儆猴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'm going to have to make an example of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.79,0:33:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.93,0:33:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.66,0:33:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.07,0:33:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她是你女朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she's your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.95,0:33:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你现在说话的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah I heard you talking, real sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.60,0:33:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎跟人类没什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell it was almost human.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.96,0:33:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.38,0:33:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.58,0:33:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以有人类的相貌 人类的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can look human, and act human.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.21,0:33:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是内心深处 你仍然是怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But deep down, you're still a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.85,0:34:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Violet 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violet, no, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.61,0:34:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Violet 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Violet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.11,0:34:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.41,0:34:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们错过了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have we missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.53,0:34:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.76,0:34:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女朋友的事我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about your girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.83,0:34:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她妨碍到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she was in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.73,0:34:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会理解我的 一定会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand.I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.73,0:34:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.50,0:34:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只看到一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only see one monster here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.65,0:35:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.06,0:35:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好起来的 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be.You.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.52,0:35:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过段时间再告诉你情况吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get back to you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.10,0:35:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sal 他说他很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sal, he said he was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.63,0:35:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were his last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.18,0:35:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,David 对不起 我是迫不得已\N{\fnArial\fs30}David, I'm sorry.I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.60,0:35:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Sal从来没对我做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sal never did anything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么他会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.22,0:35:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sal 你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sal, what are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.51,0:35:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会来了 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He isn't coming, is he.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.28,0:35:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,David很快就会到\N{\fnArial\fs30}David will be here in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.29,0:35:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不能待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.33,0:36:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.42,0:36:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他是我弟弟 Violet\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause he is my little brother, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.06,0:36:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护他是我的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.85,0:36:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须保证我们的血统纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job to keep our blood pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.31,0:36:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信血脉那些鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe that bloodline crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.91,0:36:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.63,0:36:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,血统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.57,0:36:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows our places is the one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.26,0:36:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人都认同的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all agree on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.17,0:36:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他们发现你和一个变形怪一起逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you people find out that you run out with a shifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.35,0:36:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会想方设法报仇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be looking for pay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.23,0:36:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会对我的家族穷追不舍\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will come after my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.77,0:36:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样只会两败俱伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing but bad times and dead bodies, on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.97,0:36:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,David想要离开 那是他的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}David wants to go straight, that's his call.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.83,0:36:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那只是他一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he does it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.37,0:36:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Violet 你还有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have a choice, Violet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.64,0:36:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以活着离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can either walk out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.27,0:36:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我会带你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I will take you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.11,0:36:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把你扔进湖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And dumped what's left of you in the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.49,0:36:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sal\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.96,0:36:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.57,0:36:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又能怎样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我离开了我的家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even after I left my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.26,0:37:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道事情不妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew things got bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.30,0:37:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是Sal会一直支持我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sal would always have my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.20,0:37:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.97,0:37:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到底是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.26,0:37:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.79,0:37:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.98,0:37:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.15,0:37:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃跑是你最擅长的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you do best.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.68,0:37:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,David\N{\fnArial\fs30}David.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.96,0:38:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.37,0:38:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.27,0:38:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.47,0:38:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要挑起战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants war.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.91,0:38:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.96,0:38:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些不过是个喝醉了的家伙弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these was some messed up guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.43,0:38:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Duvals都没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Duvals are clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.18,0:38:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们完事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, we done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.53,0:38:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算重回家族里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming back to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.95,0:38:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你已经离开家族了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.80,0:38:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如今我决定回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I am back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.98,0:38:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你这句话我已经等了太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've waited long time to hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.21,0:39:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家 David\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.78,0:39:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人住这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.42,0:39:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐姐住在镇子另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister is on the other side of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.42,0:39:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲离婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom is out of the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.31,0:39:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲 嗯 他殉职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad, well, he died, line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.97,0:39:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.06,0:39:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.17,0:39:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.81,0:39:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.05,0:39:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们这就上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we are on our way, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.74,0:39:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.61,0:39:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我们得离开这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah - We got a gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.13,0:40:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.90,0:40:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 这城里可是挤满了怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this city is crawling with monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.73,0:40:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cass有Metatron的消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass has a line on Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.01,0:40:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在等的不就是这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.75,0:40:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的机会来了 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our shot, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.61,0:40:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.51,0:40:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们会找其他的猎人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we will call some other hunters, some pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.15,0:40:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后解决掉这些怪物黑帮 所有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And download them on the monster mob situation, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.65,0:40:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我自己就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.34,0:40:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我是认真的 你不能自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't, seriously, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.73,0:40:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦陷得太深 你就永远不可能脱身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You getting in this too deep, there is no way getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.00,0:40:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不可能就这样抽身\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.86,0:40:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今 这是属于我的战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my fight, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.76,0:40:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼的 战争开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, it's a damn war.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.12,0:40:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得找个地方开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I gotta start somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.54,0:41:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,残酷恶行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicious Mauling.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.96,0:41:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡惨剧震惊全城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tragic Death Shocks the City.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.77,0:41:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来电 号码未知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming…unknown caller.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.20,0:41:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.83,0:41:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.51,0:41:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.13,0:41:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你开始猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you start hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.23,0:41:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些怪物会把你生吞活剥了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The monsters will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.70,0:41:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.14,0:41:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
